[statement]
`app` needs `sec`, provided at no version by `kw` and `gk`, and
`so:libw.so.1`, provided at a version by `libw` alone, which depends on the
real `kw`. `kw` is installed before `sec` is decided, though `app` lists
`sec` first, and `sec` then needs nothing more, though `gk` ranks higher
for it. A single provider's dependency on a real name is followed when its
name is reached (`a-real-name-is-followed-at-once`).

[repository]
P:app
V:1.0-r0
D:sec so:libw.so.1

P:libw
V:1.0-r0
p:so:libw.so.1=1
D:kw

P:kw
V:1.0-r0
p:sec
k:10

P:gk
V:1.0-r0
p:sec
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1.0-r0
install libw 1.0-r0
install app 1.0-r0
